---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Topics
description: Browse essays by topic — purple teaming, detection engineering, red teaming, OT security, and more.
permalink: /tags/
---

{# Bug 2 fix: read the tag list from the global data file. Eleventy 3
   exposes _data/<name>.js exports as the top-level key `<name>`, so
   the data lives at `postsByTag.tagList` and `postsByTag.postsByTag`
   (we could also rename the data file to _data/siteTags.js to make
   the key `siteTags`, but the existing name is fine). #}
{% set tagList = postsByTag.tagList or [] %}
{% if tagList and tagList.length %}
  <ul class="tag-grid" role="list">
    {% for entry in tagList %}
      <li class="tag-grid__item">
        <a href="/tags/{{ entry.slug }}/">
          <span class="tag-grid__name">{{ entry.name }}</span>
          <span class="tag-grid__count">{{ entry.count }} essay{% if entry.count != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
{% else %}
  <p class="page__lede">No tagged essays yet.</p>
{% endif %}
